            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Masa Thạch Thị Thanh",
            "review_text": "Mashajo\nKaliningrad, Russia11765 contributions\n14\nNice Japanese restaurant in a quiet area\nAug 2025 • Solo\nWent to this restaurant while walking around town. The place looks pretty invisible from the outside, but it's been much better inside. Interior is pleasant, calm atmosphere, few visitors. There are two floors, which adds comfort. The menu is extensive: a large selection of rolls, hot dishes and salads. It wasn't easy to choose. I ordered a salmon salad grill and eel rolls. The order was prepared quickly enough. The portions are large, the serving neat and appetizing. The dishes were delicious, without reproach. Service is quick and unobtrusive. It's also convenient to accept bank cards. It's a good place to have a quiet dinner with Japanese cuisine.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten April 2, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
